WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.449
Welcome to Module 3 of The Zero
Trust Assessment as Evidence:

2
00:00:04.449 --> 00:00:07.000
from results to a closure register.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.322
This module is a draft,
awaiting the editor's review,

4
00:00:10.322 --> 00:00:12.300
so recheck it after the review.

5
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:15.825
In this module the guide's results
kit does the mechanical part.

6
00:00:15.825 --> 00:00:20.145
It normalizes every result, lists what
didn't run with what to do about it,

7
00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:24.538
and writes a closure-register entry
for each finding, routed and weighed.

8
00:00:24.538 --> 00:00:27.375
People do the rest, and
the register shows where.

9
00:00:27.375 --> 00:00:32.390
It covers Steps 7 and 8 of the Zero
Trust Assessment implementation guide,

10
00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:35.980
and takes about fifty-five
minutes, most of it in Lab 1.
